{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53417","headline":"瀑布 · 白元鉴","name":"瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太极生柔德，雄姿不可名。\n淩空虹永挂，泻涧布长成。\n映日添霞色，当风振浪声。\n潺潺云水下，已得涤幽情。\n（同前第二一八○页）（按：《全唐诗补逸》卷十八收白诗，有《讲堂》、《瀑布》、《新池》诸诗，但内容均不同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}